  data: {
    LLM: "Only bid if you have 'The Mayor' of the city you want to name as trumps. Without the Mayor, your opponents can easily steal your trumps and force you into 'The Wrong Boy' traps.\n\nThe Wrong Boy Dump: If you are the declarer and you have 'The Wrong Boy', lead it on a trick where your partner has a high card but the opponents have already followed suit. This 'buries' the penalty in your own team's pile safely.\n\nBlank Card Counter: Save your 'Blank' cards for the final few tricks. If the opponents haven't played 'The Lost Heir' yet, they are likely holding it for the last trick. Use your Blank to turn their +5 point victory into a standard 1-point trick.",
    Player: "Only bid if you have 'The Mayor' of the city you want to name as trumps. Without the Mayor, your opponents can easily steal your trumps and force you into 'The Wrong Boy' traps.\n\nThe Wrong Boy Dump: If you are the declarer and you have 'The Wrong Boy', lead it on a trick where your partner has a high card but the opponents have already followed suit. This 'buries' the penalty in your own team's pile safely.\n\nBlank Card Counter: Save your 'Blank' cards for the final few tricks. If the opponents haven't played 'The Lost Heir' yet, they are likely holding it for the last trick. Use your Blank to turn their +5 point victory into a standard 1-point trick.",
